  "introduction": "Consolidate primary mathematics and prepare for secondary study through transformations and enlargement.",
  "definition": "Translations, reflections and rotations preserve lengths and angles. Enlargement about a centre multiplies distances from the centre by a scale factor. Positive enlargement factors preserve orientation; area changes by the square of the factor.",
